menc:YCbCrToRGB rdfs:label "YCbCr to RGB"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB.contract> rdfs:label "YCbCr to RGB codec contract"@en ;
    skos:definition "The codec contract of menc:YCbCrToRGB, version 1, verified by vector suite version 1: a SamplesToSamples codec that keeps no session and decodes only, takes the parameters coefficients, layout, referenceBlackWhite and subsampling, and may raise ResourceLimit and Validation errors."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB.contract.coefficients> rdfs:label "YCbCr to RGB codec contract parameter coefficients"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB.contract.layout> rdfs:label "YCbCr to RGB codec contract parameter layout"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB.contract.referenceBlackWhite> rdfs:label "YCbCr to RGB codec contract parameter referenceBlackWhite"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#YCbCrToRGB.contract.subsampling> rdfs:label "YCbCr to RGB codec contract parameter subsampling"@en .
menc:Zlib rdfs:label "zlib"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Zlib.contract> rdfs:label "zlib codec contract"@en ;
    skos:definition "The codec contract of menc:Zlib, version 1, verified by vector suite version 1: a BytesToBytes codec that keeps no session and encodes as well as decodes, takes the parameters level and trailing, and may raise Checksum, ResourceLimit and Validation errors."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Zlib.contract.level> rdfs:label "zlib codec contract parameter level"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Zlib.contract.trailing> rdfs:label "zlib codec contract parameter trailing"@en .
menc:Zstd rdfs:label "Zstandard"@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#Zstd.contract> rdfs:label "Zstandard codec contract"@en ;
    skos:definition "The codec contract of menc:Zstd, version 1, verified by vector suite version 1: a BytesToBytes codec that keeps no session and encodes as well as decodes, takes no parameters, and may raise Checksum, ResourceLimit, Unsupported and Validation errors."@en .
